  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Generate Your Data with AI\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Open your Backpack and copy your labeled plan from the previous level.\r\n\r\n2. Paste your plan into AI.\r\n\r\n3. Ask AI to generate arrays for your data.\r\n   * You should have one array for each part of your UI.\r\n   * Each array should have at least 3 items.\r\n   \r\n\r\n4. Check your arrays:\r\n   * Do all arrays have the same number of items?\r\n   * Does each index represent one complete item?\r\n\r\n### Reminder:\r\n- Each array stores one type of information\r\n- The same index across arrays should match",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
